            "title": "Description",
            "content": "<p>The Healthy Aging Collection is designed to support healthy aging by promoting cellular vitality, mental clarity, and natural motivation. Combining NAD+, Lion's Mane Mushroom, Mucuna Pruriens, Rhodiola Rosea, and essential B vitamins, this complementary system helps support cognitive performance, healthy energy metabolism, and everyday wellbeing. Each vegan bundle contains<strong> 90 NAD+ Patches</strong>,<strong>   90 Focus Patches</strong>, and <strong>90 Dopamine Patches,</strong> offering a simple, convenient alternative to pills and gummies.</p><h3></h3><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
